{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"reviews\":[{\"id\":\"structural_monotony\",\"verdict\":\"overcall\",\"rationale\":\"The document does not run one repeated section arc. It moves from personal belonging, to a concrete neighbourhood pattern, to self-revision, to a civic call to action.\",\"evidence\":[\"I have lived here long enough to know the back roads, complain about the weather with conviction, and recognise half the faces at the Saturday market.\",\"Over the past year, I have watched a family nearby become the target of complaints that others on our street never seem to attract.\",\"Recently, I began attending council sessions.\",\"So I am asking my fellow residents to look closely at what is happening around us.\"]},{\"id\":\"tonal_uniformity\",\"verdict\":\"insufficient_evidence\",\"rationale\":\"A consistent warm-civic register is plausible, but the annotator supplied no cross-document evidence for a whole-text judgment.\",\"evidence\":[\"Dear neighbours,\",\"That is why I cannot stay quiet about the way some of our neighbours are being treated.\",\"With hope and determination,\"]},{\"id\":\"faux_specificity\",\"verdict\":\"overcall\",\"rationale\":\"These details are concrete enough for an open letter. They establish local embeddedness rather than merely performing specificity.\",\"evidence\":[\"I know which bus is usually late and which bakery sells out before noon.\",\"My children learned to ride their bikes on this street.\",\"planted trees beside the oval\"]},{\"id\":\"neutrality_collapse\",\"verdict\":\"insufficient_evidence\",\"rationale\":\"The text clearly takes a position, but the annotator did not support that whole-document conclusion with evidence.\",\"evidence\":[\"That is why I cannot stay quiet about the way some of our neighbours are being treated.\",\"Yet those who live inside the pattern feel its weight every day.\",\"So I am asking my fellow residents to look closely at what is happening around us.\"]},{\"id\":\"even_jargon_distribution\",\"verdict\":\"misclassified\",\"rationale\":\"The piece contains very little technical vocabulary at all, so describing jargon as \\\"clump[ing] where the writer knows things\\\" is the wrong characterization even if the non-flagged status is reasonable.\",\"evidence\":[\"The procedures were unfamiliar, the language formal, and the confident regulars seemed to know one another.\",\"Fair treatment requires transparent processes, consistent enforcement, accessible information, and serious attention to patterns in complaints.\"]},{\"id\":\"forced_synesthesia\",\"verdict\":\"insufficient_evidence\",\"rationale\":\"No forced cross-sensory metaphor is apparent, but the annotator provided no evidence-based basis for clearing the item.\",\"evidence\":[\"It arrives as a raised eyebrow, an anonymous report, a rule enforced for one person and overlooked for another.\",\"Yet those who live inside the pattern feel its weight every day.\"]},{\"id\":\"generic_metaphors\",\"verdict\":\"supported\",\"rationale\":\"The flagged phrases are stock metaphoric shorthand rather than grounded, text-specific figurative language.\",\"evidence\":[\"It arrives as a raised eyebrow, an anonymous report, a rule enforced for one person and overlooked for another.\",\"Yet those who live inside the pattern feel its weight every day.\"]},{\"id\":\"referential_clarity\",\"verdict\":\"insufficient_evidence\",\"rationale\":\"The prose appears referentially clear, but the annotator did not substantiate the clear judgment, especially for a whole-document check.\",\"evidence\":[\"None of these incidents looks enormous on its own. That is partly how unfairness survives. It arrives as a raised eyebrow, an anonymous report, a rule enforced for one person and overlooked for another.\",\"What changed was that the record now included a perspective that would otherwise have been absent.\"]},{\"id\":\"formulaic_parallelism\",\"verdict\":\"overcall\",\"rationale\":\"The imperative sequence and the institutional list both add substantive content appropriate to an open letter; they are parallel, but not empty symmetry substituting for meaning.\",\"evidence\":[\"Learn how local decisions are made. Write to a representative. Attend one council session. Support someone who is nervous about speaking.\",\"Fair treatment requires transparent processes, consistent enforcement, accessible information, and serious attention to patterns in complaints.\"]},{\"id\":\"semantic_redundancy\",\"verdict\":\"overcall\",\"rationale\":\"The closing sentence revisits earlier themes, but as a rhetorical summation rather than redundant repetition of nearby content.\",\"evidence\":[\"I found work, friendship, and safety.\",\"I have voted in council elections, planted trees beside the oval, and stood in the school hall selling raffle tickets beside people whose grandparents were born here.\",\"This country became mine through ordinary acts: work, friendship, mourning, celebration, voting, helping, and being helped.\"]},{\"id\":\"underspecified_language\",\"verdict\":\"supported\",\"rationale\":\"These phrases rely on abstract evaluative language without naming operational criteria or concrete indicators.\",\"evidence\":[\"help make the invitation clearer, the time more accessible, or the atmosphere less hostile.\",\"Fair treatment requires transparent processes, consistent enforcement, accessible information, and serious attention to patterns in complaints.\"]},{\"id\":\"context_leakage\",\"verdict\":\"insufficient_evidence\",\"rationale\":\"The document reads as self-contained, but the annotator offered no evidence for clearing the category.\",\"evidence\":[\"I know the hesitation that comes with speaking about this.\",\"Another disagreed with me but wanted to understand.\"]},{\"id\":\"performed_candour\",\"verdict\":\"insufficient_evidence\",\"rationale\":\"There do not appear to be obvious candour-booster frames, but the annotator did not support the clear judgment.\",\"evidence\":[\"I write because my faith has matured.\",\"I no longer think belonging is a gift that can be withdrawn whenever I become inconvenient.\"]},{\"id\":\"vacuous_connection\",\"verdict\":\"insufficient_evidence\",\"rationale\":\"The logical links mostly read as explicit enough, but the annotator provided no evidence for the clear call.\",\"evidence\":[\"But gratitude and criticism are not opposites. If I care for this country, I must care when its promises are applied unevenly.\",\"None of these incidents looks enormous on its own. That is partly how unfairness survives.\"]},{\"id\":\"genre_specific\",\"verdict\":\"insufficient_evidence\",\"rationale\":\"Classifying this as `default` is plausible, but the annotator did not justify the genre decision or the absence of watchlist findings.\",\"evidence\":[\"An Open Letter to the Country I Chose\",\"Dear neighbours,\",\"With hope and determination,\"]}]}"}}
